{"unit_id":"KaramachiA217__dsh-settings-ui#card-zh","repo":"KaramachiA217/dsh-settings-ui","commit":"53c7d8adfbf52a5cca39e21eea0d0cb04cdca7ac","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-settings-ui 是面向 DSH Web 插件作者的统一设置界面与浮动面板工具包。它通过 settingsUi 服务注册插件配置卡、经典设置区块和 shell 浮层，并提供可组合的表单控件与状态管理。主要能力包括官方插件配置卡、设置表单、可拖动及可最小化面板、位置状态持久化和错误边界。适合希望为 DSH 插件快速构建一致设置界面的开发者；使用时需在 DSH Web 环境中挂载此插件。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:2133","lib/client.js:2209","cordis.patch.yml:6"]}
{"unit_id":"KaramachiA217__dsh-settings-ui#card-en","repo":"KaramachiA217/dsh-settings-ui","commit":"53c7d8adfbf52a5cca39e21eea0d0cb04cdca7ac","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-settings-ui provides settings cards, form controls, and floating panels to DSH web plugins through settingsUi. Developers can add configuration sections, manage loading and saving, and persist panel layout. It serves plugin authors building consistent interfaces in the DSH web client.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:2133","lib/client.js:2209","cordis.patch.yml:6"]}
