{"unit_id":"KaramachiA217__dsh-settings-ui#feature-1","repo":"KaramachiA217/dsh-settings-ui","commit":"53c7d8adfbf52a5cca39e21eea0d0cb04cdca7ac","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-settings-ui 的功能「插件配置卡」：让消费插件声明配置卡并在官方插件设置槽或经典设置页展示。调用 settingsUi.pluginCard 并提供 key、标题及字段等配置，产出绑定设置状态的卡片。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:2209","lib/client.js:2356"]}
{"unit_id":"KaramachiA217__dsh-settings-ui#feature-2","repo":"KaramachiA217/dsh-settings-ui","commit":"53c7d8adfbf52a5cca39e21eea0d0cb04cdca7ac","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-settings-ui 的功能「设置状态管理」：createSettingsStore 和 useSettings 管理配置加载、保存、错误及成功提示。消费方传入设置范围或 fenced API，获得可订阅的表单状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:807","lib/client.js:947"]}
{"unit_id":"KaramachiA217__dsh-settings-ui#feature-3","repo":"KaramachiA217/dsh-settings-ui","commit":"53c7d8adfbf52a5cca39e21eea0d0cb04cdca7ac","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-settings-ui 的功能「浮动面板状态」：createPanelStore 管理面板开合、最小化、位置和尺寸；可传 persist 键将布局状态写入 localStorage，供面板组件读取。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:967","lib/client.js:990"]}
{"unit_id":"KaramachiA217__dsh-settings-ui#feature-4","repo":"KaramachiA217/dsh-settings-ui","commit":"53c7d8adfbf52a5cca39e21eea0d0cb04cdca7ac","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-settings-ui 的功能「声明式表单行」：Rows 根据字段描述渲染开关、复选框、多行文本、下拉选择和文本输入控件；用户编辑后通过 onChange 回传字段名和值。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:679","lib/client.js:708"]}
